    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up for your fishing adventure across a chain of unique islands! Whether you're casting lines off the coast or hauling in the big catch deep at sea, you'll have plenty of tools to make every trip count.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179010/extras/5498a2217240fae42ede64dd6de06814.poster.avif?t=1753734198\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179010/extras/5498a2217240fae42ede64dd6de06814.webm?t=1753734198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179010/extras/5498a2217240fae42ede64dd6de06814.mp4?t=1753734198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179010/extras/1a351cbd5652773f5aaed074fbf1bb9f.poster.avif?t=1753734198\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179010/extras/1a351cbd5652773f5aaed074fbf1bb9f.webm?t=1753734198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179010/extras/1a351cbd5652773f5aaed074fbf1bb9f.mp4?t=1753734198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing Traps:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set it and forget it! Perfect for passive fishing while you explore or take on other tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179010/extras/8ea12a1a2801afeb025c03861d82241a.poster.avif?t=1753734198\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179010/extras/8ea12a1a2801afeb025c03861d82241a.webm?t=1753734198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179010/extras/8ea12a1a2801afeb025c03861d82241a.mp4?t=1753734198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing Rods </strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casting Rod Equipped for accurate long-distance casting, these rods target larger fish species in deep seas. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179010/extras/eb8d2bf17add7a89be977b9248dcdf7b.poster.avif?t=1753734198\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179010/extras/eb8d2bf17add7a89be977b9248dcdf7b.webm?t=1753734198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179010/extras/eb8d2bf17add7a89be977b9248dcdf7b.mp4?t=1753734198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><strong>Boats:\u00a0</strong>From dinghies to decked-out deep-sea rides, your boat is your best buddy out on the water. Some are fast, some are sturdy, and some have room for a lot of fish. Upgrade them at Outposts to turn your humble hull into a fishing machine! <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179010/extras/2d5900be870e04cb8f9bcacc6e000464.poster.avif?t=1753734198\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179010/extras/2d5900be870e04cb8f9bcacc6e000464.webm?t=1753734198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179010/extras/2d5900be870e04cb8f9bcacc6e000464.mp4?t=1753734198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outpost:</strong>\u00a0Dock your boat and gear up! Upgrade your boats here to improve speed, storage, and more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179010/extras/a95cf30c1d79b0fa336c068b67b96880.poster.avif?t=1753734198\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179010/extras/a95cf30c1d79b0fa336c068b67b96880.webm?t=1753734198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179010/extras/a95cf30c1d79b0fa336c068b67b96880.mp4?t=1753734198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Shovel:</strong>\u00a0Dig up upgrades or uncover hidden treasures. More useful than it looks!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179010/extras/84ffc74a36eef7f658d87991ff246228.poster.avif?t=1753734198\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179010/extras/84ffc74a36eef7f658d87991ff246228.webm?t=1753734198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179010/extras/84ffc74a36eef7f658d87991ff246228.mp4?t=1753734198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ultimate Fish Wagon: Your Reliable Catch Companion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No fishing adventure is complete without a reliable way to transport your precious catch. Introducing the fishing wagon \u2013 an essential tool for transporting and storing your fish as you explore new waters and expand your fishing empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179010/extras/7266c6a24923f3f3d920ffe5fd09dcf7.poster.avif?t=1753734198\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179010/extras/7266c6a24923f3f3d920ffe5fd09dcf7.webm?t=1753734198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179010/extras/7266c6a24923f3f3d920ffe5fd09dcf7.mp4?t=1753734198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Selling the Fish:</strong><br>Got fish? Turn those fins into funds! Wheel your haul into town, strike a deal, and watch your wallet grow. Save up for better rods, bigger boats, or just blow it all on a shiny new shovel\u2014no judgment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179010/extras/4b35d06797d4b1f19f1d84f35b012e66.poster.avif?t=1753734198\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179010/extras/4b35d06797d4b1f19f1d84f35b012e66.webm?t=1753734198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179010/extras/4b35d06797d4b1f19f1d84f35b012e66.mp4?t=1753734198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
